    standfirst: "\"We need better reporting\" hides three different problems. Separating the reporting layer, the model and the integration tells you what to buy, and in what order.",
    blurb: "Better reporting can mean three different problems. Separate the reporting layer, the model and the integration, and the Power BI or warehouse question answers itself.",
